  "body": "As #1185 is getting longer I'm worried I will start to miss things. Making a list here of things to double check. This is mainly for myself, but @yoavweiss and @noamr are free to use it and add to it, of course. We can also use this issue to settle architecture questions.\r\n\r\n- [x] Does it deal with `blob:` and `data:` URLs correctly?\r\n- [x] Are fields correctly set for synthetic responses?\r\n- [ ] How does the setup for `<iframe>` and other browsing context containers work?\r\n- [x] Have you done an editorial pass on \"recording connnection timing info\"?",
